1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,467
Comfyrizz turns one package into a finished launch video.

2
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:06,200
Everything you see is generated from code.

3
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:09,033
Generated-first assets start as SVG.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,867
Each vector is sanitized and render-checked on the CPU before it reaches the composition.

5
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:18,033
This launch video renders locally in about eighty seconds.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,467
No GPU, no cloud, and no network calls during the render.

7
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:25,800
The timeline locks integer frames at thirty per second.

8
00:00:25,967 --> 00:00:29,767
Speech sets the scene length, and fades overlap instead of stacking.

9
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:31,600
Three rules keep it honest.

10
00:00:31,767 --> 00:00:33,500
Measure every narration chunk.

11
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:35,400
Never clip or speed up speech.

12
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:38,800
Export captions from the same cues the player uses.

13
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:41,600
Ready to render, locally and deterministically.

14
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:42,733
Comfyrizz.
